  "question": {
    "text": "Let the image of the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>in the plane passing through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> equal to"
